(6427762, 954181, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, though there are some very evident signs of selective editing around the edges of the bird. It is especially visible around the underside. When masking such an image, I find a soft edged masking brush helps such things to look reasonably natural.</td>', 'A nice shot, though there are some very evident signs of selective editing around the edges of the bird. It is especially visible around the underside. When masking such an image, I find a soft edged masking brush helps such things to look reasonably natural.', '2011-05-30 01:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
