(6428480, 954117, 99263, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. The composition is great and contains a lovely contrast with the blackbird and the fence it''s perched on nicely in focus and the background dof beyond the bird and fence. The plant growing up against the fence completes the image nicely. 9</td>', 'Beautiful capture. The composition is great and contains a lovely contrast with the blackbird and the fence it''s perched on nicely in focus and the background dof beyond the bird and fence. The plant growing up against the fence completes the image nicely. 9', '2011-05-30 15:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6428482, 954125, 125975, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a subject here to capture my attention.  My eye goes first to the large hay bale in the foreground but then quickly goes to other areas in the image but doesn''t find anything to rest upon.  I wonder if you got a lot closer to the hay and showed it''s texture, if that would be better?  Not sure.</td>', 'I don''t see a subject here to capture my attention.  My eye goes first to the large hay bale in the foreground but then quickly goes to other areas in the image but doesn''t find anything to rest upon.  I wonder if you got a lot closer to the hay and showed it''s texture, if that would be better?  Not sure.', '2011-05-30 15:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
