(6433650, 953089, 104230, '<td valign="top">From Fells point or maybe Harbor East? I know that area has been developed quite a bit since I left 10 years ago.  Nice image, great reflections (no water taxis breaking up the smooth surface of the water), but I find the color of the border quite distracting.</td>', 'From Fells point or maybe Harbor East? I know that area has been developed quite a bit since I left 10 years ago.  Nice image, great reflections (no water taxis breaking up the smooth surface of the water), but I find the color of the border quite distracting.', '2011-06-04 01:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433932, 953977, 64086, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and the textures. The chair really adds interest. It seems a bit dark to me overall. I think it could use some editing or lighting to bring out the chair and parts of the wall and to emphasize the doors.</td>', 'I really like the composition and the textures. The chair really adds interest. It seems a bit dark to me overall. I think it could use some editing or lighting to bring out the chair and parts of the wall and to emphasize the doors.', '2011-06-04 14:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433936, 954208, 64086, '<td valign="top">The foot gesture is perfect. The blur seems just right and the pink and blue go very well.</td>', 'The foot gesture is perfect. The blur seems just right and the pink and blue go very well.', '2011-06-04 14:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6433941, 953981, 64086, '<td valign="top">Lovely and mysterious. That''s a big chunk of black and a large white area. I think it works very well. I just noticed the guy walking the dog on the right. I''m glad I came back for another look.</td>', 'Lovely and mysterious. That''s a big chunk of black and a large white area. I think it works very well. I just noticed the guy walking the dog on the right. I''m glad I came back for another look.', '2011-06-04 14:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
