(6434574, 953979, 104230, '<td valign="top">Back to bump and comment. Very effective. A busy scene, but it manages not to overwhelm with detail.  I think the perspective provided by the street helps in this regard.  My eye gets carried to the gray building at the end.  The awnings help frame the image, and provide additional perspective.  Great processing. Lovely tones and saturated colors.</td>', 'Back to bump and comment. Very effective. A busy scene, but it manages not to overwhelm with detail.  I think the perspective provided by the street helps in this regard.  My eye gets carried to the gray building at the end.  The awnings help frame the image, and provide additional perspective.  Great processing. Lovely tones and saturated colors.', '2011-06-05 13:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
