(6436167, 953816, 3936, '<td valign="top">This should be a mural, or at least hung in a gallery.  Absolutely beautiful.  What a timeless image!  Those could be tire trcks, or just as easily wagon tracks from a hundred years ago.  Fantastic job on an absolutely classic image...</td>', 'This should be a mural, or at least hung in a gallery.  Absolutely beautiful.  What a timeless image!  Those could be tire trcks, or just as easily wagon tracks from a hundred years ago.  Fantastic job on an absolutely classic image...', '2011-06-06 19:09:24.000000', NULL, 0),
