(6436197, 954188, 2158, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon.  I missed this one during voting.  It''s a wonderful shot.</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon.  I missed this one during voting.  It''s a wonderful shot.', '2011-06-06 20:03:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6436209, 953097, 112739, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bergiekat:</b></div><hr/><i> Double trouble! What great detail and curious if you used flash on this. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No flash was used, just that massive ISO of 12800 and the rest was done with careful processing. I also used my 2X extender which takes that 70-200 lens aperture to f/8. Not much light comes through with that. I also used the spot metering setting since it was actually fairly darker inside the tree trunk. I didnt want to take the chance of the evaluative setting with a challenging exposure like that. <br/> <br/>Thanks again everyone for all your great comments! Very Happy with the outcome of this shot.</td>', 'Originally posted by bergiekat: Double trouble! What great detail and curious if you used flash on this.   No flash was used, just that massive ISO of 12800 and the rest was done with careful processing. I also used my 2X extender which takes that 70-200 lens aperture to f/8. Not much light comes through with that. I also used the spot metering setting since it was actually fairly darker inside the tree trunk. I didnt want to take the chance of the evaluative setting with a challenging exposure like that.  Thanks again everyone for all your great comments! Very Happy with the outcome of this shot.', '2011-06-06 20:17:43.000000', NULL, 0),
