(6436709, 953816, 48228, '<td valign="top">THANK YOU MARGARET for your kind words to me.....<br/> <br/>I may not be here much at DPC, as it hard to some days to type or even read what I have typed (they are the very bad days) but when I do and if something stands out, I try to leave a message of support...<br/> <br/>YOU have really touched me with your style and also the true AUSSIE spirit I see in you LANDSCAPES as if the photos were actual PAINTINGS... Not easy to achieve, but something I admire so much... A wonderful natural photographer with good techniques in procesing is what you have a gift for, and this produces the lovely images you make me admire..... <br/> <br/>THANK YOU from shez</td>', 'THANK YOU MARGARET for your kind words to me..... I may not be here much at DPC, as it hard to some days to type or even read what I have typed (they are the very bad days) but when I do and if something stands out, I try to leave a message of support... YOU have really touched me with your style and also the true AUSSIE spirit I see in you LANDSCAPES as if the photos were actual PAINTINGS... Not easy to achieve, but something I admire so much... A wonderful natural photographer with good techniques in procesing is what you have a gift for, and this produces the lovely images you make me admire.....  THANK YOU from shez', '2011-06-07 08:22:40.000000', NULL, 0),
