(6438826, 954069, 19944, '<td valign="top">Wow.  No comments during voting.<br/> <br/>I like the processing.  It gives it a very ominous feeling.  What I think may have hurt you is that without the title, I have no idea what I am supposed to be seeing, other than a middle school.  I honestly didn''t even notice the fence until I read the title.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-06-08 15:39:14.</i></td>', 'Wow.  No comments during voting. I like the processing.  It gives it a very ominous feeling.  What I think may have hurt you is that without the title, I have no idea what I am supposed to be seeing, other than a middle school.  I honestly didn''t even notice the fence until I read the title.', '2011-06-08 16:38:41.000000', '2011-06-08 16:39:14.000000', 0),
(6438915, 954069, 102278, '<td valign="top">I think this is excellent. I didn''t get to view/vote in the challenge but i would have scored this very highly. Wonderful ominous feel to it. Clouds are great and the composition works splendidly.</td>', 'I think this is excellent. I didn''t get to view/vote in the challenge but i would have scored this very highly. Wonderful ominous feel to it. Clouds are great and the composition works splendidly.', '2011-06-08 17:13:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438930, 953715, 129267, '<td valign="top">During the challenge, I gave you a 5. <br/> <br/>For me, the negative space is what''s interesting about this shot, but I don''t think it''s being portrayed in an interesting (graphic) way. I think I would have liked to have seen the crop to be rotated so that the stem was vertical, or angled more intentionally/dramatically. (30-45 degrees). As it sits now, it seems like attention was given to exposure and color, but the composition seems to be a bit less than considered.</td>', 'During the challenge, I gave you a 5.  For me, the negative space is what''s interesting about this shot, but I don''t think it''s being portrayed in an interesting (graphic) way. I think I would have liked to have seen the crop to be rotated so that the stem was vertical, or angled more intentionally/dramatically. (30-45 degrees). As it sits now, it seems like attention was given to exposure and color, but the composition seems to be a bit less than considered.', '2011-06-08 17:33:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6438962, 953715, 7889, '<td valign="top">Gave it a 5 . I just do not find anything interesting in the shot.</td>', 'Gave it a 5 . I just do not find anything interesting in the shot.', '2011-06-08 18:10:22.000000', NULL, 0),
